# Per-element subscope call — refused (PHASE5C-TUTORIAL §3, the 2-4 flank)

The tutorial's 2-4 shape: a subscope call *per list element*
(`map each g among … to (output of … with {…}).field`). Per-element
instantiation mints one anonymous callee instance per element, which the
creation-per-subject key cannot carry — refused until designed.

```catala
declaration scope Kamer:
  input grondslag content integer
  output bedrag content integer

scope Kamer:
  definition bedrag equals grondslag * 2

declaration scope Aanslag:
  input grondslagen content list of integer
  output bedragen content list of integer

scope Aanslag:
  definition bedragen equals
    map each g among grondslagen to (output of Kamer with { -- grondslag: g }).bedrag
```
